{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50639","headline":"汝州北楼晚望少室诗 · 胡证","name":"汝州北楼晚望少室诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峭拔烟云外，雄居造化工。\n三山慙海上，五岳让天中。\n翠积当华甸，腾标占太空。\n周临万里暮，犹挂夕阳红。\n（见《槐庐丛书》《金石录补》。\n）（〖1〗叶九来《金石录补》卷十九《唐胡证题少室诗》跋尾：「右唐检校祠部员外郎胡证《汝州北楼晚望少室诗》，诗云〖不重录〗。\n永贞元年仲夏记。\n按新旧《书·证传》皆云贞元中登第，繇浑瑊举爲从事，自殿中侍御史爲韶州刺史而已。\n据此碑。\n先爲祠部员外郎，可以补史之阙漏。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡证","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}